// @trap unaligned
// An atomic access must be naturally aligned, unlike `__load_i32__`, which reads at any
// address. The four-byte load at address 2 traps: V8 reports "operation does not support
// unaligned accesses", wasmtime "unaligned atomic". The line before shows the aligned
// neighbour runs.
print(__atomic_load_i32__(4))
print(__atomic_load_i32__(2))
